108:The test set in this competition is only available when your code is submitted. The sample_submission.csv provided in the public set is an empty placeholder that shows the required submission format; you should perform your modeling, cross-validation, etc., using the training set, and write code to process a non-empty sample submission. It will contain rows with id, class and predicted columns as described in the Evaluation page.
109-
110-When you submit your notebook, your code will be run against the non-hidden test set, which has the same folder format (<case>/<case_day>/<scans>) as the training data.
